<figure id="Sx1.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="Sx1.T7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table A7</span>: </span><span id="Sx1.T7.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Quantitative comparison of shape abstraction generation with randomly selected pivots. Results are evaluated at <math id="Sx1.T7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math>=5 and <math id="Sx1.T7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math>=8.<span id="Sx1.T7.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> MMD-CD scores and MMD-EMD scores are scaled by <math id="Sx1.T7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10^{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{3}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Sx1.T7.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, respectively. The best results are highlighted in </span>bold<span id="Sx1.T7.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">.</span></span></figcaption>
