<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.11 </span>More Qualitative Results of Box-Splitting Generation</h3>

<div id="Sx1.SS11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx1.SS11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Figure <a href="#Sx1.F8" title="Figure A8 ‣ A.11 More Qualitative Results of Box-Splitting Generation ‣ Appendix ‣ BoxSplitGen: A Generative Model for 3D Part Bounding Boxes in Varying Granularity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A8</span></a>, we present more qualitative results of box splitting generation and box-to-shape generation.</p>
