<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Sx1.F9.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Figure A9</span>: </span><span id="Sx1.F9.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:129%;">Qualitative comparison of shape abstraction generation. <span id="Sx1.F9.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> For each pair of columns, we query the ground truth shape and retrieve the closest generated boxes measured with chamfer distance. Our method demonstrates higher-fidelity boxes.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
