<section id="Sx1.SS12" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.12 </span>More Qualitative Results of Box-Conditioned Shape Generation</h3>

<div id="Sx1.SS12.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx1.SS12.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#Sx1.F11" title="Figure A11 ‣ A.12 More Qualitative Results of Box-Conditioned Shape Generation ‣ Appendix ‣ BoxSplitGen: A Generative Model for 3D Part Bounding Boxes in Varying Granularity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A11</span></a> presents more qualitative results of box-conditioned shape generation.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Sx1.F11" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
