<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Sx1.F13.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Figure A13</span>: </span><span id="Sx1.F13.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:129%;">Gallery of our generated bounding boxes and their final decoded 3D shapes by box-conditioned shape generation network.<span id="Sx1.F13.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Each pair of columns shows the input condition bounding box (left) and its corresponding decoded 3D shape (right).</span></span></figcaption>
